            "review_title": "Review at Bar Rơm Thảo Điền",
            "review_text": "Thanh-Tram Dang\n14 contributions\n0\nhidden & casual binchotan grill - bar in Thao Dien, D2\nJul 2026 • Friends\nMy go-to spot for natural wine (orange was so good) & Vietnamese ingredient cocktails.\n\nI love everything they've created here, from the vibe and music to the great grilled food. Despite the Japanese charcoal grill, I've never left with my clothes smelling like smoke. Such a huge plus\n\nHighly recommend if you're looking for a great place in Thảo Điền for drinks and small bites.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten September 15, 2026",
